This is a modified version of InfiniPaint, maintained at https://github.com/CreativeKidofGod/infinipaint and based on https://github.com/ErrorAtLine0/infinipaint. Modifications started in October 2026. It is not an official InfiniPaint release.

Third party libraries are used in this project. The licenses for these libraries are included in data/third_party_licenses. This directory includes licenses for direct dependencies, as well as for some of the dependencies for libraries used by this project.
